# Harvest capture

Visual QA for Keep harvest lives in `web/captures/harvest/latest/`.

After Start / Stop on `/preview?view=chat` with `npm run capture:sink` running in `web/`:

1. Read `web/captures/harvest/latest/meta.json` (mixer settings, fps, scorecard).
2. Read `frame-00.jpg` … in order. These are the motion, not screenshots of a paused state.
3. Judge smoothness, theme, outline leak, nested liquid, burst corners, pebble reach. Do not argue from description if frames exist.

The mixer is the left rail on `/preview`. Replay also records. Lab URL can save to the Mac only when the sink is listening on `127.0.0.1:8791`.
